WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6ae152bbbf9d11c475011619 — Episode 1 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:19.010
Mr. Sterling, you just got off a global call.

2
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.010
You've been up all night. You need to rest.

3
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.510
No. They're waiting on me for breakfast.

4
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.510
You are the rightful head of Sterling Group.

5
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:27.510
The whole family's waiting for you to take over.

6
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.510
Yet you're playing house husband for the Whitmeald.

7
00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.010
Cooking and cleaning?

8
00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.010
I like my life the way it is.

9
00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.510
Seven years ago, I promised my grandfather I'd marry Alida.

10
00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.510
Today, the seven years are up.

11
00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.730
I'm telling her everything.

12
00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.730
Tonight at the gala, I'm revealing who I really am.

13
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.130
I'll introduce Alada to the world.

14
00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:52.130
She'll finally be the real Mrs. Sterling.

15
00:00:52.130 --> 00:01:12.240
Stop it.

16
00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.240
My parents and daughter are right upstairs.

17
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.580
That's not what you said last night.

18
00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.580
Alara, what the hell is going on?

19
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:23.570
Why is he here?

20
00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.570
Cal, what are you doing home?

21
00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.570
Relax man. I just brought her home.

22
00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:31.570
She had a few too many drinks, so I crashed on the couch to make sure she was fine.

23
00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:33.570
You think I'm a damn idiot?

24
00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.570
Alara, it's fine. I'll just go.

25
00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.570
Don't fight with him over me.

26
00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:39.970
This is my house.

27
00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:41.970
I don't need your permission to have guests over.

28
00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.970
Starting today, Chase is moving in.

29
00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:49.970
For seven years, I ironed every shirt on your back.

30
00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.970
I cooked every meal for Willa.

31
00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.970
I cleaned every inch of this house.

32
00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.970
You're just too useless to get a real job.

33
00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.970
Stop acting like you sacrificed everything for me.

34
00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.970
So nothing I did ever mattered to you?

35
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.970
Who the hell do you think you are yelling at my daughter?

36
00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.370
She puts food on the table while you leech off her.

37
00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:10.370
Know your place.

38
00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:12.370
Chase is an executive at Sterling.

39
00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.370
He has money, he has status, he belongs with Alara.

40
00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.370
You don't even have a job. You're nothing but a maid.

41
00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:18.370
Come on guys, give Cal a break.

42
00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.370
He did take care of her.

43
00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:23.370
Uncle Chase, thank you for the dress from last night.

44
00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.370
I love it.

45
00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:30.630
Anything for you, sweetie.

46
00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.630
Willa, sweetie, come here. Daddy made your breakfast.

47
00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:36.630
Uncle Chase says real men make money, not just cook.

48
00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:40.820
What are you just standing there for?

49
00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:43.820
Put the food on the table, we're starving.

50
00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.820
You heard them Cal, stop embarrassing everyone.

51
00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:54.170
You want breakfast?

52
00:02:54.170 --> 00:03:01.130
Eat up.

53
00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:05.130
After tonight, you will be on your knees begging me to come back.
